   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Hypothesis loop: plan, query, check, narrow\n\u2022 Context budget: summarise tool output\n\u2022 Read-only tools; writes need human approval\n\u2022 Cost + time budget per run\n\u2022 Evals on replayed past incidents\n\u2022 Show evidence, not just an answer",
   "originalText": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Hypothesis loop: plan, query, check, narrow\n\u2022 Context budget: summarise tool output\n\u2022 Read-only tools; writes need human approval\n\u2022 Cost + time budget per run\n\u2022 Evals on replayed past incidents\n\u2022 Show evidence, not just an answer",
